  | STAR
  | SIG
  | SEMISEMI
  | SEMI
  | RPAREN
  | REC
  | RBRACKET
  | RBRACE
  | QUOTED_STRING_ITEM of (string * Location.t * string * Location.t * string option)
  | QUOTED_STRING_EXPR of (string * Location.t * string * Location.t * string option)
  | QUOTE
  | QUESTION
  | PRIVATE
  | PREFIXOP of (string)
  | PLUSEQ
  | PLUSDOT
  | PLUS
  | PERCENT
  | OR
  | OPTLABEL of (string)
  | OPEN
  | OF
  | OBJECT
  | NONREC
  | NEW
  | MUTABLE
  | MODULE
  | MINUSGREATER
  | MINUSDOT
  | MINUS
  | METHOD
  | METAOCAML_ESCAPE
  | METAOCAML_BRACKET_OPEN
  | METAOCAML_BRACKET_CLOSE
  | MATCH
  | LPAREN
  | LIDENT of (string)
  | LETOP of (string)
  | LET
  | LESSMINUS
  | LESS
  | LBRACKETPERCENTPERCENT
  | LBRACKETPERCENT
  | LBRACKETLESS
