  | LBRACKETATATAT
  | LBRACKETATAT
  | LBRACKETAT
  | LBRACKET
  | LBRACELESS
  | LBRACE
  | LAZY
  | LABEL of (string)
  | INT of (string * char option)
  | INITIALIZER
  | INHERIT
  | INFIXOP4 of (string)
  | INFIXOP3 of (string)
  | INFIXOP2 of (string)
  | INFIXOP1 of (string)
  | INFIXOP0 of (string)
  | INCLUDE
  | IN
  | IF
  | HASHOP of (string)
  | HASH
  | GREATERRBRACKET
  | GREATERRBRACE
  | GREATER
